    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Behan, Irwin & Gosling are delighted to present this charming one-bedroom cottage for sale in one of Cork City's most convenient and sought-after locations.\r\nNo. 137 Blarney Street comes to the market in good condition throughout and offers an excellent opportunity for its new owners to add their own personal touch. The property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking accommodation for family members attending college or working in the city.\r\nSituated within walking distance of Cork City Centre and a wide range of amenities, the property enjoys close proximity to University College Cork, Cork College of Commerce, St. John's Central College, the Mercy University Hospital, and the Bons Secours Hospital.\r\nThis low-maintenance home benefits from on-street parking permits and offers comfortable accommodation comprising: Entrance Hallway, Living/Dining Room, Kitchen, Shower Room, Double Bedroom, Storage Room.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the attic has been converted and is currently used for storage purposes and the property has gas fired central heating with hot water on demand (i.e. no immersion)..\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment through the sole selling agents, Behan, Irwin & Gosling."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation consists of the following:\r\n\r\nEntrance / Hallway (1.84m x 2.76m)\r\nPVC double glazed front door with frosted glass inset leading to hallway with laminate wood floor, centre light, radiator, 2 power points.\r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.90m x 2.76m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, window, radiator, centre light, 6 power points.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.44m x 2.15m)\r\nFully fitted kitchen with single drainer stainless steel sink, window to the rear of property, plumbed for washing machine, centre light, 'under cabinet' lighting, tiled splash back, radiator, ceramic tiled floor, 6 power points, gas boiler.\r\n\r\nShower Room (2.45m x 1.24m)\r\nWC, WHB, corner electric shower unit, tiled splashback, ceramic tiled floor, lights, door to the back of the house, window to the rear of property, radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom (2.47m x 3.67m)\r\nCarpet Floor covering, radiator, velux window, storage, wardrobe centre light, 4 power points.\r\n\r\nStorage (3.05m x 0.91m)\r\n\r\nStorage room (5.18m x 2.13m)\r\nVelux window, recessed lighting, carpet floor covering, radiator 8 power points, storage into eaves of the roof. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nTo the front of property - on street parking available with a parking permit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent location being within walking distance of all locale amenities.\r\nPVC double glazed windows and gas central heating.\r\nAttic converted for storage purposes.\r\nParking permit available for on street parking."
      },
